# Personal Overrides (gitignored)

Copy this file to `CLAUDE.local.md` and edit. It is loaded after `CLAUDE.md` and
overrides anything declared there. Never commit it.

## Local environment paths

- Python venv: `~/.venvs/<project>`
- Data dir: `~/data/<project>`
- Redis URL: `redis://localhost:6379/0`

## Debugging shortcuts

- Bypass semantic cache: set `CACHE_BYPASS=1`
- Verbose tracing: `LOG_LEVEL=DEBUG`
- Use the local vector index instead of remote: `VECTOR_BACKEND=local`

## Private preferences

- I prefer running `pytest -x -vv` while iterating.
- When asked to draft a commit message, follow Conventional Commits (`feat:`, `fix:`...).
